{
  "form": "ca_568",
  "title": "Form 568",
  "taxYear": 2025,
  "years": [2025, 2026],
  "about": "California Form 568, Limited Liability Company Return of Income: the LLC fee and annual tax (Side 1) and Schedule B, Income and Deductions. Line numbers of the 2025 FTB form; check them against the FTB's final form - the lines are kept in one file (taxForms/ca_568.json).",
  "reports": [
    {
      "key": "tax-568",
      "label": "CA Form 568 (Draft)",
      "basis": "pl",
      "rows": [
        { "heading": "Side 1 - LLC Fee and Annual Tax", "prefix": "Side 1 " },
        { "line": "s1", "num": "1", "label": "Total income from Schedule IW - every income account, before cost of goods sold", "calc": ["@income"] },
        { "line": "s2", "num": "2", "label": "Limited liability company fee", "fee": "s1" },
        { "line": "s3", "num": "3", "label": "Annual limited liability company tax", "fixed": 800 },
        { "heading": "Schedule B - Income", "prefix": "Schedule B " },
        { "line": "1a", "label": "Gross receipts or sales", "sign": 1, "group": "income" },
        { "line": "1b", "label": "Returns and allowances", "sign": -1, "group": "income" },
        { "line": "1c", "label": "Balance - line 1a less line 1b", "calc": ["1a", "-1b"] },
        { "line": "2", "label": "Cost of goods sold", "sign": -1, "group": "income" },
        { "line": "3", "label": "Gross profit", "calc": ["1c", "-2"] },
        { "line": "4", "label": "Ordinary income (loss) from other partnerships, LLCs, estates, and trusts", "sign": 1, "group": "income" },
        { "line": "5", "label": "Net farm profit (loss)", "sign": 1, "group": "income" },
        { "line": "6", "label": "Ordinary gain (loss)", "sign": 1, "group": "income" },
        { "line": "7", "label": "Other income (loss)", "sign": 1, "group": "income" },
        { "line": "8", "label": "Total income (loss)", "calc": ["3", "4", "5", "6", "7"] },
        { "heading": "Schedule B - Deductions", "prefix": "Schedule B " },
        { "line": "9", "label": "Salaries and wages (other than to members)", "sign": -1, "group": "deductions" },
        { "line": "10", "label": "Guaranteed payments to members", "sign": -1, "group": "deductions" },
        { "line": "11", "label": "Repairs and maintenance", "sign": -1, "group": "deductions" },
        { "line": "12", "label": "Bad debts", "sign": -1, "group": "deductions" },
        { "line": "13", "label": "Rent", "sign": -1, "group": "deductions" },
        { "line": "14", "label": "Taxes and licenses", "sign": -1, "group": "deductions" },
        { "line": "15", "label": "Interest", "sign": -1, "group": "deductions" },
        { "line": "16a", "label": "Depreciation", "sign": -1, "group": "deductions" },
        { "line": "17", "label": "Depletion", "sign": -1, "group": "deductions" },
        { "line": "18", "label": "Retirement plans, etc.", "sign": -1, "group": "deductions" },
        { "line": "19", "label": "Employee benefit programs", "sign": -1, "group": "deductions" },
        { "line": "20", "label": "Other deductions", "sign": -1, "group": "deductions" },
        { "line": "21", "label": "Total deductions", "calc": ["@group:deductions"] },
        { "line": "22", "label": "Ordinary income (loss) from trade or business activities", "calc": ["8", "-21"], "grand": true },
        { "heading": "Rental Real Estate - Form 8825, to Schedule K Line 2" },
        { "line": "rent", "num": "-", "label": "Gross rents (Form 8825)", "sign": 1, "group": "rental" },
        { "line": "rentexp", "num": "-", "label": "Rental real estate expenses (Form 8825)", "sign": -1, "group": "rentalexp" },
        { "line": "rentnet", "num": "-", "label": "Net rental real estate income (loss) - Schedule K line 2", "calc": ["rent", "-rentexp"] }
      ],
      "summary": [["Total Income for the Fee (Side 1 Line 1)", "s1"], ["LLC Fee (Line 2)", "s2"], ["Ordinary Income (Line 22)", "22", "tone"]],
      "feeTiers": [[250000, 0], [500000, 900], [1000000, 2500], [5000000, 6000], [null, 11790]],
      "notes": [
        "The LLC fee reads every income account on the books (gross receipts and other income, before cost of goods sold, rental income included) as California source - apportion it on Schedule IW if the LLC earns income outside California. Fee: under $250,000 none; $250,000 to $499,999 $900; $500,000 to $999,999 $2,500; $1,000,000 to $4,999,999 $6,000; $5,000,000 and over $11,790. The $800 annual tax is due whatever the income.",
        "Rental real estate is reported through Form 8825 and Schedule K line 2, not Schedule B: for an LLC whose revenue is mostly rent, the rent and its expenses are suggested on the Rental Real Estate lines, outside lines 1 to 22."
      ]
    }
  ],
